               PERFORM RECONCILE-WITH-PROFITS-0008.
               PERFORM VALIDATE-VALUE-0009.
               PERFORM RESOLVE-REG-NUMBER-0010.
               PERFORM VALIDATE-SUM-ASSURED-0011.
               PERFORM CHECK-TERM-0012.
               PERFORM APPLY-CC-RATING-0013.
